  - psychoacoustic metrics
  - sound quality
  - loudness
  - sharpness
  - roughness
  - fluctuation strength
  - tonality
  - ISO 532
  - ECMA-418
  - DIN 45692
  - open source software
  - list
  - sound quality metrics
  - LISQM
license: MIT
